  "post_content": "<p>(28 fotos) La xiqueta Andrea Palanques Ramos (al centre de la foto, amb jersei rosa) ser&agrave; la festera major infantil de Suera 2018, despr&eacute;s del sorteig que s&#39;ha fet a &uacute;ltima hora del mat&iacute; d&#39;aquest diumenge al sal&oacute; de plens de l&#39;Ajuntament, presidit per l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Mart&iacute; Garcia. L&#39;acompanyar&agrave; el xiquet Miquel Poles Pallar&eacute;s com a fester major infantil.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/IMG-20180506-WA0052.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 270px;\" /></p>\n<p>La resta de la cort d&#39;honor queda de la manera seg&uuml;ent:</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/05/IMG-20180506-WA0063.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 532px;\" /></p>\n<p>La presentaci&oacute; de les festeres i festers infantils ser&agrave; durant les festes d&#39;agost.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigfesteresinfantilssuera/img-20180506-wa0029.jpg\" alt=\"img-20180506-wa0029\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigfesteresinfantilssuera/img-20180506-wa0030.jpg\" alt=\"img-20180506-wa0030\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigfesteresinfantilssuera/img-20180506-wa0031.jpg\" alt=\"img-20180506-wa0031\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigfesteresinfantilssuera/img-20180506-wa0032.jpg\" alt=\"img-20180506-wa0032\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigfesteresinfantilssuera/img-20180506-wa0033.jpg\" alt=\"img-20180506-wa0033\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pu